Dumping counter_next:
FunctionDecl counter_next 'int (int)'
|-ParmVarDecl used step 'int'
`-CompoundStmt
  |-DeclStmt
  | `-VarDecl used counter 'int' static cinit
  |   `-IntegerLiteral 'int' 0
  |-CompoundAssignOperator 'int' lvalue '+=' ComputeLHSTy='int' ComputeResultTy='int'
  | |-DeclRefExpr 'int' lvalue Var 'counter' 'int'
  | `-ImplicitCastExpr 'int' <LValueToRValue>
  |   `-DeclRefExpr 'int' lvalue ParmVar 'step' 'int'
  `-ReturnStmt
    `-ImplicitCastExpr 'int' <LValueToRValue>
      `-DeclRefExpr 'int' lvalue Var 'counter' 'int'

